  "content": "<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>💎 本模组包对矿洞进行了改进，内容更加丰富，敬请体验！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>✨ 原版矿洞依然完好无损，因此我没有改动它们。相反，我添加了全新的矿洞类型，请深入深层岩层探索，迎接全新的地下挑战。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🧨 添加了许多主题房间，让你始终有新鲜感，永不无聊。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🎨 超过10种类型，每种都有独特之处，有些可能比其他矿洞含有更多矿石，甚至可能有新的生物...</strong></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>兼容世界生成数据包（如 Terralith）</strong></span><strong><br>报告错误、提供反馈或帮助开发，我们有一个<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fCZQthZJjPc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span>频道，这里大家都很友好！</strong></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/949138580415062017?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/623723?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">兼容性</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msMOOMq.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9IxCUYAP/images/bfb9e0f54b08f1018ff643dbdde1c0da7b1cb2bb.png\" alt=\"缩略图\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LQXHEUd.png\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DycIqbn.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1gTe61a.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iiqmpgHLLcE\" width=\"641\" height=\"377\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/l9VYc8La5mg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"641\" height=\"641\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fhoponomc